## Customization

| Theme token | Used for |
|-------------|----------|
| `--tx-border-color-lighter` | Group border and header divider. |
| `--tx-fill-color-dark` / `--tx-fill-color` / `--tx-fill-color-light` | Header, row, and hover surfaces. |
| `--tx-text-color-primary` / `--tx-text-color-secondary` | Titles, labels, descriptions, guidance arrows, and the loading ring. |
| `--tx-color-primary` / `--tx-color-primary-dark-2` | Link-row text and hover colors. |
| `--tx-color-white` | Loading shimmer highlight. |
